WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.882 --> 00:00:02.217
Greetings. Bill Nye here.

00:00:02.992 --> 00:00:04.911
Welcome to the Disaster Institute.

00:00:05.489 --> 00:00:08.367
Earth is constantly on the edge of disaster.

00:00:12.291 --> 00:00:13.876
Viewer discretion is advised.

00:00:15.379 --> 00:00:17.798
Why is it that every disaster movie

00:00:17.798 --> 00:00:21.385
begins with someone in power
ignoring a scientist?

00:00:21.643 --> 00:00:24.021
People are sick of all the doom and gloom.

00:00:24.021 --> 00:00:25.940
Because it happens
more than you might think.

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:28.372
This is gonna really suck.

00:00:29.112 --> 00:00:29.863
Nuts?

00:00:31.621 --> 00:00:33.290
It doesn't have to go down that way.

00:00:33.671 --> 00:00:35.339
Together we can save Earth,

00:00:36.139 --> 00:00:36.931
with science.

00:00:37.467 --> 00:00:41.054
Join me as I take on six world-ending disasters.

00:00:44.048 --> 00:00:45.300
Each one

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:48.067
leading to my imminent doom.

00:00:48.067 --> 00:00:49.276
Brace yourselves!

00:00:50.877 --> 00:00:52.670
So yeah, I guess you could say

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:54.756
I really am dying to save the world.

